@Component("stripeGateway")
class StripeGateway implements PaymentGateway { /* ... */ }

@Component("payPalGateway")
class PayPalGateway implements PaymentGateway { /* ... */ }

@Service
class OrderService {
    private final PaymentGateway gateway;

    // Two PaymentGateway beans exist -> name the one you want
    OrderService(@Qualifier("stripeGateway") PaymentGateway gateway) {
        this.gateway = gateway; // injects StripeGateway, not PayPalGateway
    }
}
```
Without the `@Qualifier`, Spring throws `NoUniqueBeanDefinitionException` at startup.

